 "description": "Publishes the video to the user's own Bilibili channel. **It appears on their channel and enters review, and this cannot be undone.** Before calling it, use huasheng_export_video to get a link so the user can watch it, and confirm the title with them. Export not ready \u2192 published=false and task_id, nothing posted; call again with task_id. **Publishing is not idempotent** \u2014 do not retry on failure or timeout, because that can post it twice. Have the user check their uploads first. If Bilibili suggests no category, pass archive.tid.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
